WEBVTT

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:03.566
Chicago has failed startups. For years, our founders have

00:00:03.566 --> 00:00:07.051
been building and isolation with no communities to support

00:00:07.051 --> 00:00:10.595
them. That changes today. Today we're launching Density, an

00:00:10.595 --> 00:00:13.667
invite only founder LED collective of Chicago's top

00:00:13.667 --> 00:00:16.916
startups. For the past year, we've been working on our

00:00:16.916 --> 00:00:20.342
startups together in person, sharing advice and investing

00:00:20.342 --> 00:00:23.532
in each other's growth. Our members include YC alums,

00:00:23.532 --> 00:00:26.959
Sequoia back founders, exited founders and startups doing

00:00:26.959 --> 00:00:30.200
millions in revenue. And now for the first time ever.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:33.276
We're opening up our applications to the public. We're

00:00:33.276 --> 00:00:36.632
looking for the best and brightest entrepreneurs in Chicago

00:00:36.632 --> 00:00:39.932
to join us so together we can build successful businesses,

00:00:39.932 --> 00:00:43.064
invest as local angels, and repeat the cycle. You don't

00:00:43.064 --> 00:00:46.420
have to move to Silicon Valley to build successful startups.

00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:49.776
If you want to come work with Chicago's top founders every

00:00:49.776 --> 00:00:52.720
single day, apply a Density dot Ventures.

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:58.170
We're here building even on Saturdays, so come join us.